node_modules/
data/*.json

# dist/ is NOT ignored here.
#
# Every TypeScript door ships its compiled dist/ - it is what the board
# actually runs, and the root .gitignore re-includes Doors/*/dist/ for
# exactly that reason. This file used to ignore `dist/`, `*.js` and `*.d.ts`
# on its own, which overrides the root's re-include, so WHIP reached the
# live board as sources with no entry point at all: its package.json main is
# dist/index.js, and /app/data/bbs/Doors/whip had no dist directory
# (2026-09-02). The door could not start.
